      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "What defines the photic zone?",
          "0-200 m where light supports net photosynthesis"
        ],
        [
          "Why is tropical open ocean nutrient-poor?",
          "Strong thermocline blocks deep nutrient mixing"
        ],
        [
          "What is the OMZ and why does it exist?",
          "O₂ minimum zone (200-1000 m): decomposition exceeds O₂ supply"
        ],
        [
          "What is DVM?",
          "Diel vertical migration: animals feed at surface at night, hide in deep by day"
        ],
        [
          "Why are hadal trenches not food deserts?",
          "V-shape funnels and concentrates organic matter"
        ],
        [
          "What limits vertebrate depth?",
          "TMAO accumulation — likely toxic above ~300 mmol/kg"
        ],
        [
          "What zone covers the most Earth surface?",
          "Abyssal (4000-6000 m): ~60% of Earth's surface"
        ],
        [
